{"id":"vod_jy_39664","vodId":"39664","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"轻音少女 第二季","name_cn":"轻音少女 第二季","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第27集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/d805b3977c018e4f8d30c5e6b0e59b42.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在樱丘高中，围绕着由五个成员组成的轻音部展开。这支名为“放学后茶会”的乐队中，担任吉他和主唱的是天然呆少女平沢唯（丰崎爱生暂无内容配音），担任贝斯手的是稳重但容易害羞的秋山澪（日笠阳子暂无内容配音），担任鼓手的部长，是非常有活力的田井中律（佐藤聪美暂无内容配音），温柔热情的键盘手是琴吹紬（寿美菜子暂无内容配音），吉他手是学妹中野梓（竹达彩奈暂无内容配音）。新学年开始，除了小梓，大家都升上三年级，还被分到了同一个班级。然而要是再不招揽新成员入部，来年四名成员毕业离校，轻音部就要面临废部的命运了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-12-28 17:45:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":27,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xboA81ke/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Ddwn21zb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbm7853e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/YergB1La/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/kazqQk2e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/RdGwzl5d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dN7Xv8e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/5eVJoEoe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Qe1VEyqa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9b6YGENa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg783je/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/penG73pa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9avmR3ne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9aA8WVje/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJEzmyb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/YaOJLrEe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/NbWWpDob/index.m3u8"},{"name":"